 rpt←{andtypes}showonly types;all;t;x
⍝ Call showactions but restrict the list to only those classes or categories listed in the right argument
⍝ If the left argument is provided, with the same sort of values, restrict the list to rows that are simultaneously members of both arguments
⍝ Special right-argument commands: '≢' (count all classes & actions); '⍳' (enumerate all supported classes)
 all←showactions
 :If ∨/'⍴≢'∊types ⍝ Return a count of available classes and actions
     rpt←0 2⍴0
     rpt⍪←(≢∪all[;1]~'(shared)' '(Draw)')'Classes'
     t←'Methods' 'Properties' 'Events' 'Operations'
     x←(t ⎕C⍛⍳all[;2]){⍺,≢⊃,/⍵}⌸(⊂⊂'')~¨⍨,¨all[;3]
     rpt⍪←t,⍨⍪x←x[x[;1]⍳⍳≢t;2]
     rpt⍪←(+/x)'Total actions'
     ⍝? Note: prototype dwi version for METSIM supported exactly 312 total actions across 20 classes
 :ElseIf '⍳'∊types ⍝ Return a list of currently-supported classes
     rpt←∪all[;1]~'(shared)' '(Draw)'
 :Else
     rpt←∨/(all[;1 2]~¨⊂'()')∊⍥⎕C(,¨⊆types)~¨⊂'()'
     :If 2=⎕NC'andtypes'
         rpt∧←∨/(all[;1 2]~¨⊂'()')∊⍥⎕C(,¨⊆andtypes)~¨⊂'()'
     :EndIf
     rpt←rpt⌿all
 :EndIf
